 "arrive_text": "Above the inner bank the noise of the craftsmen's quarter drops away. The houses up here stand in their own yards, long timber halls with carved posts at the doors, and there's a square of ditched ground with an altar in it where the council of the Aedui meets in the open air. The biggest hall on the hill, with a line of horses tethered outside it and somebody always going in or out, belongs to Dannotalos.",
